Estimated Hours:  {!ProjectLineItem.Est_Hours__c}
Actual Billable Hours:  {!ProjectLineItem.Billable_Hours_Worked__c}
Remaining Hours:  {!ProjectLineItem.Billable_Hours_Remaining__c}

click the link below to view the Project in 
{!OrgBaseUrl}/{!ProjectLineItem.Id}</text>
